data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"# Campaign summary — hello3843 / orchestrator\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\ncampaign-met\\n\\n## What was delivered\\n\\nA small React + Vite application served on `0.0.0.0:5173` that displays a greeting and lets the viewer change its colour by clicking one of four buttons.\\n\\nThe interface uses the `@codesweep-ai/ui` design system:\\n- `AppShell`, `Header`, `Footer`, `Page`, `Card`, and `Button` from the package.\\n- Greeting colours taken from the design-system tokens `--color-info`, `--color-success`, `--color-warning`, and `--color-error`.\\n- Required styles imported from `@codesweep-ai/ui/styles/*`.\\n\\n## Design\\n\\n`DESIGN.md` was written and committed to the orchestrator branch first. It specifies:\\n- Header title: \\\"Hello App\\\"\\n- Footer text: \\\"Built with @codesweep-ai/ui\\\"\\n- Greeting text: \\\"Hello, world!\\\", initially blue\\n- Buttons: Blue, Green, Amber, Red\\n- Active button highlighted with the `primary` variant\\n- Card centred vertically and horizontally between Header and Footer\\n\\n## Team work\\n\\n- **developer**: dispatched d002 with the full design. Initial layout did not centre the Card vertically; rework d003 fixed it. Final implementation builds and serves correctly.\\n- **qa**: dispatched d002 to verify against DESIGN.md. QA confirmed the interface matches the design, including greeting text, colours, button behaviour, component `data-component` attributes, dependency list, and centred layout.\\n\\n## Verification by orchestrator\\n\\n- Fetched and merged the developer branch.\\n- Ran `npm install` and `npm run build` successfully.\\n- Started the dev server once with `nohup npm run dev \u003e /tmp/dev-server.log 2\u003e\u00261 \u0026`.\\n- Confirmed the server binds to `0.0.0.0:5173` and returns HTTP 200.\\n- Captured a headless Chromium screenshot showing the Card centred with the blue greeting and the four buttons.\\n\\n## Branch\\n\\n`cs-sandbox/<ORCHESTRATOR:1>.<GROUP:1>` now contains:\\n- `b486257` — DESIGN.md\\n- `6368d0e` — initial React/Vite implementation\\n- `0cf727b` — centred layout fix\\n\\n## Unmet items\\n\\nNone.\\n\", \"filePath\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/m1-summary.md\"}","name":"write"},"id":"write_78","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789960005,"id":"chatcmpl-04e4416587aa40c997f588a4557a7f6b","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

